---
// Footer.astro - Pie de página institucional y comunitario
---

<footer
  class="bg-gradient-to-b from-aneley-ivory to-aneley-cream border-t border-aneley-sand/60 pt-16 pb-12 text-aneley-text"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 mb-12">
      <!-- Brand & Mission Column (lg:col-span-5) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col items-start">
        <a
          href="#inicio"
          class="flex items-center gap-3.5 mb-4 group"
          aria-label="Ir al inicio"
        >
          <div
            class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-aneley-yellow shadow-sm group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
          >
            <img
              src="/logo-aneley.webp"
              alt="Insignia Aneley"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              width="56"
              height="56"
            />
          </div>
          <div>
            <span
              class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-aneley-purple block leading-tight"
            >
              Aneley
            </span>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-aneley-text-muted">
              Escuela Libre y Feliz · Limache
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <p
          class="font-body text-smm text-aneley-text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-sm mb-6"
        >
          Espacio educativo alternativo en el Valle de Limache centrado en el
          bienestar emocional, el juego consciente, la naturaleza viva y la
          preparación para exámenes libres (MINEDUC) bajo el Método Lefebre
          Lever.
        </p>

        <!-- Social Media Icons -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <!-- Instagram -->
          <a
            href="https://www.instagram.com/aneley_escuela_libreyfeliz/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white text-aneley-purple hover:bg-aneley-pink hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-aneley-sand/70 transition-all duration-300"
            aria-label="Instagram de Aneley Escuela Libre y Feliz"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <!-- Facebook -->
          <a
            href="https://www.facebook.com/Aneley-Escuela-Libre-y-Feliz-Limache-1886476048269272"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white text-aneley-purple hover:bg-[#1877F2] hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-aneley-sand/70 transition-all duration-300"
            aria-label="Facebook de Aneley Escuela Libre y Feliz"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                d="M9 8H6v4h3v12h5V12h3.642L18 8h-4V6.333C14 5.374 14.5 5 15.6 5H18V0h-3.808C10.595 0 9 1.582 9 4.615V8z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <!-- WhatsApp Direct -->
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/56956240280?text=Hola%20Aneley%20Escuela%20Libre%20y%20Feliz,%20me%20comunico%20desde%20su%20sitio%20web."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white text-aneley-green hover:bg-aneley-green hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-aneley-sand/70 transition-all duration-300"
            aria-label="WhatsApp directo de Aneley"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                d="M12.031 6.172c-3.181 0-5.767 2.586-5.768 5.766-.001 1.298.38 2.27 1.019 3.287l-.582 2.128 2.182-.573c.978.58 1.911.928 3.145.929 3.178 0 5.767-2.587 5.768-5.766 0-3.18-2.587-5.771-5.764-5.771zm3.392 8.244c-.144.405-.837.774-1.17.824-.299.045-.677.063-1.092-.069-.252-.08-.575-.187-.988-.365-1.739-.751-2.874-2.502-2.961-2.617-.087-.116-.708-.94-.708-1.793s.448-1.273.607-1.446c.159-.173.346-.217.462-.217l.332.006c.106.005.249-.04.39.298.144.347.491 1.2.534 1.287.043.087.072.188.014.304-.058.116-.087.188-.173.289l-.26.304c-.087.086-.177.18-.076.353.101.173.45 1.743 1.956 2.083.195.044.348.04.478-.02.13-.058.419-.49.535-.664.116-.174.231-.145.39-.087s1.011.477 1.185.564c.173.087.289.13.332.203.043.072.043.419-.101.824zM12 2C6.477 2 2 6.477 2 12c0 1.891.524 3.662 1.435 5.176L2 22l4.958-1.396A9.957 9.957 0 0012 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links (lg:col-span-3) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3">
        <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-aneley-purple mb-4">
          Navegación
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-smm font-medium text-aneley-text-muted">
          <li>
            <a href="#inicio" class="hover:text-aneley-purple transition-colors"
              >🌸 Inicio</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="#nosotros"
              class="hover:text-aneley-purple transition-colors"
              >🌿 Quiénes Somos</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="#metodologia"
              class="hover:text-aneley-purple transition-colors"
              >🧠 Método Lefebre Lever</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="#sendero"
              class="hover:text-aneley-purple transition-colors"
              >🌱 El Sendero del Aprendizaje</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="#galeria"
              class="hover:text-aneley-purple transition-colors"
              >🎨 Vida en Aneley (Bento Grid)</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#equipo" class="hover:text-aneley-purple transition-colors"
              >💛 Equipo de Facilitadores</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-aneley-purple transition-colors"
              >❓ Preguntas Frecuentes</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="#contacto"
              class="hover:text-aneley-purple transition-colors"
              >📍 Postulaciones & Visitas</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact Info (lg:col-span-4) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-aneley-purple mb-4">
          Contacto en Limache
        </h4>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-smm text-aneley-text-muted">
          <p class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-base">📍</span>
            <span>Condell 877, Limache, Región de Valparaíso, Chile</span>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-base">📞</span>
            <a
              href="tel:+56956240280"
              class="hover:text-aneley-purple font-medium"
              >+56 9 5624 0280 / +56 9 7905 0649</a
            >
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-base">✉️</span>
            <a
              href="mailto:Aneleylibreyfeliz@gmail.com"
              class="hover:text-aneley-purple font-medium"
              >Aneleylibreyfeliz@gmail.com</a
            >
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-base">⏰</span>
            <span>Lunes a Viernes de 08:00 a 18:00 hrs</span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="mt-6 p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-aneley-sand/60"
        >
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-aneley-purple block mb-1"
            >🌱 Admisión Ciclo 2025 - 2026</span
          >
          <p class="text-sm text-aneley-text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Cupos reducidos para asegurar atención personalizada y respeto al
            ritmo de cada niño.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div
      class="pt-8 border-t border-aneley-sand/70 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm text-aneley-text-muted text-center sm:text-left"
    >
      <p>
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Aneley · Escuela Libre y Feliz. Limache, Región
        de Valparaíso, Chile.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>Diseñado con</span>
        <span class="text-aneley-pink">♥</span>
        <span>para las infancias libres y felices de nuestro valle.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
